Each item is one FinQA question with findings that cite numbered evidence lines.
PASS items keep the human-verified gold evidence of FinQA. INSUFFICIENT and
CONTRADICTORY items are generated from it: an INSUFFICIENT item cites sentences
of the same page that are not gold evidence, and a CONTRADICTORY item adds a
line that restates a gold value with a changed number. A sample of the items is
checked by hand (see REVIEW.md). The examples are chosen by hand. Run
build_finqa_verdicts.py to regenerate verdict_items.jsonl and REVIEW.md from a
copy of test.json.
